  <item>
    <title>Vol.14 超级正经的减肥指北：浅析如何三个月瘦三十斤</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671e66da44ae79002c7606ec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671e66da44ae79002c7606ec</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近一个月比较忙没有更</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是粉丝居然还在涨！</span></p><span></span><p><span>那我必须带着慢慢的诚意坚持更新</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为经常性刷脂和减肥的“健身人士”（其实就是管不住嘴）</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年三月到六月我共计减了35斤</span></p><span></span><p><span>趁着还没有反弹，请来几位朋友一起聊一聊如何科学减肥</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿瓜：我本人</span></p><span></span><p><span>墩墩：长沙脱口秀演员，是墩墩不是吨吨也不是蹲蹲</span></p><span></span><p><span>rayray：酗酒的“瘦胖子”，成都一支麦喜剧新晋大总管</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 你是什么时候发现自己开始变胖？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> 变胖之后你都有什么烦恼？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 减肥过几次？开始的原因？失败的原因？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1658">27:38</a> 从这儿开始讲干货了!减肥=心态+方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a> 减肥期间正确的心态与减肥常见误区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2377">39:37</a> 减肥=少吃+多动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2383">39:43</a> 减肥怎么动？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a> 减肥怎么吃？碳循环与轻断食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5918">01:38:38</a> 关于减肥的几个小技巧&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：火箭少女101-《卡路里》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【一些照片】</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后祝大家都能健健康康减肥，快快乐乐生活！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjwSyshA5b4X73uePQFa2kGTfGA-.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmECv-GE83t7DI9rJDcXsQHupUZ-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhDayKJp4fBTnurr503xSvZk_7yu.m4a" length="153616899" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:31:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgJn3gGeLj3_9MjrbcHvE6EdXmPj.jpg"/>
