  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.13 反霸凌指北：成为打入阴霾的那一束光吧！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f0417d6920a36bfce12410</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f0417d6920a36bfce12410</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Sep 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，好久不见咯</span></p><span></span><p><span>断更一个月是不是以为老板带着小姨子跑路了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>很不好意思，前段时间因为个人封闭培训加搬家，断更一阵子</span></p><span></span><p><span>节后的第一个周末，咱这不就带着诚意满满的节目回来了</span></p><span></span><p><span>除了因为好久没用设备，忘了按录制键其余都很顺利</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期我们就来聊一聊我们经历过的那些霸凌</span></p><span></span><p><span>【写在前面】</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别隆重宣传一下，我们的主播how首个个人专场</span></p><span></span><p><span>《没法聊了》</span></p><span></span><p><span>10月5日，成都后仰喜剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>来，就对了</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿瓜：我本人</span></p><span></span><p><span>才正：看起来老老实实其实是小学某帮派副队长的才正</span></p><span></span><p><span>how：看起来凶狠冷酷其实曾经遭受“霸凌”的how</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> how的个人专场《没法聊了》10月5日成都后仰喜剧见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="136">02:16</a> 霸凌这个词怎么来的？什么意思？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="191">03:11</a> 聊一聊从小到大经历过的霸凌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">07:06</a> 学校里的那些“梳子帮”与“镜子帮” &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1429">23:49</a> 热暴力与冷霸凌，什么样的人容易被霸凌？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1791">29:51</a> 霸凌产生的原因——聚众、圈子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2066">34:26</a> 聊一聊长大以后经历的一些霸凌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2416">40:16</a> 旁观是不是另一种霸凌？ &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2709">45:09</a> 如何避免霸凌发生？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3437">57:17</a> 作为旁观者，我们该做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：五月天-《玫瑰少年》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvZAdvSOWppxYmf9Hw1_QbR5l1VZ.m4a" length="139292714" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgJn3gGeLj3_9MjrbcHvE6EdXmPj.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.12 唐朝穿越指北：西安人的城墙下是西安人的肉夹馍</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c211a933591c27befca93e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c211a933591c27befca93e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，本期指北录是我在旅行途中录制</span></p><span></span><p><span>本身想着gap一段时间，带着我的设备一路指北</span></p><span></span><p><span>没想到才到西安便被召回，所以就有了这期在小旅馆里匆匆忙忙录制的最新一期</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期我请到了现在在西安的两位老朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>和他俩聊一聊西安的吃喝玩乐交通出行以及杂七杂八</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿瓜：我本人</span></p><span></span><p><span>马一超：实名上网的一个西安土著</span></p><span></span><p><span>小超：没咋说话的半个西安打工人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a> 西安必吃榜？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="343">05:43</a> 聊一聊肉夹馍和魏家产业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a> 聊一聊泡馍和本地人珍藏推荐几家小店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> 面？好吃的面！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2554">42:34</a> 西安必玩榜！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3151">52:31</a> 个人向旅行推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3314">55:14</a> 西安出行与住宿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3687">01:01:27</a> 西安与成都内核有什么区别？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3808">01:03:28</a> 西安人请讲西安话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3946">01:05:46</a> 西安人请用西安话唱西安歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4156">01:09:16</a> 西安人唱着西安歌走向国际列车</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：程渤智-《西安人的歌》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luhZ0buEmyxq3yV_RlLZiKQVCl71.m4a" length="148204743" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgJn3gGeLj3_9MjrbcHvE6EdXmPj.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.11 健身房使用指北：健身老中青三代为您的健身房首秀保驾护航</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b9c95f33591c27be7af786</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b9c95f33591c27be7af786</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Aug 2024 08:35:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎来到指北录第十一期！</span></p><span></span><p><span>上一期寄予厚望，但是宣传结果还是不尽如人意，但！这不重要</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我重振旗鼓，开启了新的一个系列，这个系列我将聊一聊一切和健身有关的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为一个健身老炮，曾经的健身私教，三大项快破600kg的猛男</span></p><span></span><p><span>本系列我将邀请周围健身的朋友和大家聊聊健身房、减肥、增肌、力量训练等等</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一期我们就和大家分享一下第一次踏入健身房的种种建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿瓜：猛男本人</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rayray：被how拐来的成都后仰喜剧大总管</span></p><span></span><p><span>how：这期没睡过是因为晚上十一点录得how</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a> 第一次踏入健身房的初衷是什么？是多大？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a> 第一次踏入健身房是怎样的？都有哪些种类的健身房？我们应该选择哪种？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1468">24:28</a> 如何判断一家健身房值不值得办卡？如何选择一个合适的健身房？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2081">34:41</a> 初次去健身房，发生过什么尴尬或者有趣的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2306">38:26</a> 要不要请私教？如何选择一个适合你的私教？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3381">56:21</a> 第一次进入健身房该怎么做？该带什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4241">01:10:41</a> 在健身房遇到过什么奇怪的人或事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4643">01:17:23</a> 健身房奇怪声音大赏（温馨提示：戴上耳机）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4877">01:21:17</a> 少男少女健身房安全使用说明</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：SiBon-《我每天都健身》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【最后几张图】</span></p><span></span><p><span>老中青三代合照</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FntQRb1MJrz4_43-WVBbqqjr4_Bv.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>黄”枪“</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh0VNWS2u2xLUr2QAelPcPvi537J.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>听我的，没错！懂了吧？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loEcMt1RduN95A8_S403sTvcBy-t.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkQDiGSw8CSLml6gzvYdPrzxRAw8.m4a" length="186574121" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:36:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgJn3gGeLj3_9MjrbcHvE6EdXmPj.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.10 宇宙漫游指北：梦境、奇思妙想与思绪万千</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66afa2337349f7a557b3441a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66afa2337349f7a557b3441a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，欢迎来到指北录第十期！（虽然是实际上的第十一期）</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期是指北录里程碑的一期，也是指北录克服艰难险阻崭新带来的一期</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢每一位陪伴的听众和朋友，我也尽量做到第二十期，三十期，一百期</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期可以说是诚意满满，是我早就想好的选题，聊一聊梦、幻想和思考</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿瓜：我本人</span></p><span></span><p><span>艾克：被how拐来的成都后仰喜剧签约演员（大家快去线下支持演出）</span></p><span></span><p><span>柠檬：职业律师、高校老师，爱做梦的双师</span></p><span></span><p><span>荷叶：做了一个很恐怖的监控工作软件的码农</span></p><span></span><p><span>注：how睡过头了没来</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> 为啥要聊宇宙漫游？漫游是啥？怎么漫游？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> 梦境</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> 聊一聊有趣的梦</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 有哪些梦让你害怕、难过、印象深刻？（无恐、放心食用）</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">21:37</a> 日有所思夜有所梦，有这种梦吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 其他和梦有关的杂七杂八（梦话、盗梦空间、清醒梦）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> 奇思妙想</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a> 都有过哪些幻想？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2518">41:58</a> 幻想过成为什么人？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2714">45:14</a> 和幻想有关的杂七杂八（心盲症、博物馆奇妙夜、小动物会幻想吗？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2991">49:51</a> 思绪万千</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">50:20</a> 你什么时候爱思考？都会思考什么呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4052">01:07:32</a> 村上春树、马伯庸与史铁生</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4459">01:14:19</a> 分崩离析说明人们还在思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4508">01:15:08</a> 今天没有三句半，分别上个价值吧（真的很好很好这部分）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：天唱组合-《快乐小神仙》（快乐星球片尾曲，来自艾克推荐）</span></p><span></span><p><span>词太适合这期了，我摘几句：</span></p><span></span><p><span>我要飞我要飞我要飞我要飞</span></p><span></span><p><span>到宇宙里游一游/在银河中转一转/去星球间玩一玩/回到地球算一站</span></p><span></span><p><span>【最后】</span></p><span></span><p><span>想象力是人类漫游宇宙除了太空飞船以为唯一的交通工具</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家做个好梦，保持幻想、热爱思考！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrtLpeoFcrBEf1af8QjWkGBU-6Lg.m4a" length="164907395" type="audio/mp4"/>
