    <guid isPermaLink="false">6676ea89b6a841272996560d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Jun 2024 15:15:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>紧急加更！紧急加更！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿瓜：我本人</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：寿星阿瓜</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 盘点历史上今天出生的名人和代表作，以及他们和我的类似（尤其是郑容和）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 盘点历史上的今天，并简要锐评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> 622三大事件：夏至、考试、出分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 星座误区，我到底是巨蟹还是双子！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="332">05:32</a> 新的一岁，我有哪些变化？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> 重点来咯！生日的仪式感应该由自己创造</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a> 最后的碎碎念</span></p><span></span><p><span>【最后碎碎念】</span></p><span></span><p><span>生日的最后两个小时又做了自己喜欢的博客</span></p><span></span><p><span>想和大家分享由自己创造仪式感生日的快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>努力且勇敢，普通且自信</span></p><span></span><p><span>新的一岁，依旧要生在阳光中，阿瓜！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你真的听到这里，那你真的是我最好最好的朋友！</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱你们！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【来几张配图】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmCLfYYPi_Fido8ZxXRjnGuuwLM-.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luJ3Y66-DOftGKVuWRHl7Rvo6fsQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvgWhlwmv_Z54bAH-kpf9jmUGPSl.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpnvkC42P6N9JDKfVKiB-u_bH3t9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ll9MTJVf8hP5XCG-MgcQ8cttLpK9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
